{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/e23f25dd479ce8a0f6370cae84cdb7d0.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a new twist on a familiar genre \ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astral Throne II: Age of the Phoenix</i> is a Roguelite Strategy/Tactical RPG, blending elements of the classics with a modern twist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a fantastical journey of revenge and conspiracy, written by award-winning fantasy novelist<i> Shami Stovall</i>, writer of series such as<i> Firth Chronicles</i>,<i> Chronos Chronicles</i>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of tightly designed strategic battles while building a formidable army though Roguelike-style upgrades and loot. Experiment with party synergies, combining skills, equipment, and classes as you advance across a procedurally generated world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock characters and grow their relationships at camp in-between runs. Customize your expeditions as you make lasting progress on your continent-spanning quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/88bc60462945c9513b2d170cf7b76a58.poster.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/88bc60462945c9513b2d170cf7b76a58.webm?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/88bc60462945c9513b2d170cf7b76a58.mp4?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/09212efc9f18b64c2e8f21f16712ec88.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=164 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astral Throne II </i>continues the unique blend of <strong>Roguelike, Strategy, and RPG</strong>\u00a0introduced in its predecessor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize around <strong>Weapon and Magic triangles</strong>, stat and experience distribution, and <strong>permadeath</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build each character</strong> throughout runs with <strong>loot, level-ups, shops</strong>, and other discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters are <strong>handcrafted</strong> to retain the tight design of a strategic experience, but have pockets of variation to keep you on your toes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically navigate a dynamic\u00a0<strong>ever-changing world map</strong>, ensuring no two runs look alike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/5fe133df57aba45dbe53f70902727413.poster.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/5fe133df57aba45dbe53f70902727413.webm?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/5fe133df57aba45dbe53f70902727413.mp4?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/e5c584e3092ddde6b2291bc823dcf352.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=164 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>varied team</strong> of <strong>memorable characters</strong>, from valiant knights to wily gamblers and everything in between</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize your builds with <strong>hundreds</strong> of <strong>skills, weapons, and items</strong>, which differ every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your gameplay to run-altering <strong>collectibles</strong> that can significantly\u00a0<strong>shift gameplay mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No grinding</strong> or stat-increasing meta-progression, you must strategize to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/d75988279d007a670fa7aa5a83fabe35.poster.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/d75988279d007a670fa7aa5a83fabe35.webm?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/d75988279d007a670fa7aa5a83fabe35.mp4?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/9cadde373f41c84ebe456df95a2bdaec.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=164 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep and compelling narrative <strong>written by the award-winning fantasy novelist<i> Shami Stovall.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break free from prison</strong> and progress through a <strong>continent-spanning quest</strong> of revenge and conspiracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make <strong>long-term meta-progress</strong> as you complete each act piece by piece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your character's <strong>bonds</strong> through a <strong>relationship system</strong> that progresses with each run (and can even turn\u00a0<strong>romantic</strong>, if you choose)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/47691caa97fd64845fc49795b636310f.poster.avif?t=1773949461\" width=780 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/47691caa97fd64845fc49795b636310f.webm?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/extras/47691caa97fd64845fc49795b636310f.mp4?t=1773949461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084400?t=1773949461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/f972638dfa81c8434440b945c5dc0362e8c00e07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773949461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/36f480da1bb36f9bab6b39ad887990bc8ed66934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773949461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084400/36f480da1bb36f9bab6b39ad887990bc8ed66934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773949461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller suppor